# This repo is PUBLIC. See "Security & privacy" in README.md.

# ── Secrets: never commit ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real values live in a local .env, `wrangler secret put`, and EAS environment variables.
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.crt
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
*.jks
*.keystore
certs/
credentials.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
.wrangler/

# ── Personal financial data: bank files, databases, exports ──────────
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite*
exports/
imports/
*.csv
*.ofx
*.qfx
!fixtures/**/*.csv
!fixtures/**/*.ofx
!fixtures/**/*.qfx
maestro/screenshots/

# ── Design exports from the private Figma file (stay on Andy's Mac) ──
docs/screens/*
!docs/screens/README.md

# ── Tooling (M0 adds the Expo template's entries) ────────────────────
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts
/ios
/android
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.*
.DS_Store
